---
---

<div class="onboarding-step-pane" data-step-pane="connect">
  <div class="step-intro-header">
    <span class="step-num-badge">BƯỚC 04/05</span>
    <h2>Kết nối Thanh toán & Kênh Phân phối</h2>
    <p>Liên kết cổng thanh toán QR VietQR (PayOS) và Bot Telegram để vận hành bán hàng tự động 100%.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="connect-sections-stack">
    <!-- Section 1: PayOS (VietQR) -->
    <section class="connect-card payos-card">
      <div class="connect-card-header">
        <div class="connect-title-icon">
          <span class="provider-logo-badge payos-badge">QR</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Cổng Thanh Toán VietQR (PayOS)</h3>
            <p>Khách quét mã QR chuyển khoản ngân hàng, tiền về thẳng STK cá nhân/doanh nghiệp của bạn.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="connection-status-pill" data-payos-status-pill data-status="unlinked">Chưa kết nối</span>
      </div>

      <div class="connect-guide-box">
        <strong>💡 Hướng dẫn nhanh:</strong>
        <ol>
          <li>Đăng nhập <a href="https://payos.vn" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">payos.vn ↗</a> và tạo <em>Kênh thanh toán</em> mới.</li>
          <li>Sao chép 3 thông số: <code>Client ID</code>, <code>API Key</code>, <code>Checksum Key</code> và dán vào dưới đây.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <form class="credential-form-grid" data-payos-form novalidate>
        <div class="form-group full-width">
          <label for="payos-client-id">Client ID <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
          <input id="payos-client-id" name="clientId" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="d827f8a1-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx" required data-input-payos-client-id />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="payos-api-key">API Key <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
          <input id="payos-api-key" name="apiKey" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="c394d21e-xxxx-xxxx" required data-input-payos-api-key />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="payos-checksum-key">Checksum Key <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
          <input id="payos-checksum-key" name="checksumKey" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="8b91a74e-xxxx-xxxx" required data-input-payos-checksum-key />
        </div>
        <div class="connect-form-actions full-width">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-verify-connect" data-btn-verify-payos>
            <span>Xác thực & Kết nối PayOS</span>
          </button>
          <p class="crypto-note">Khóa bí mật được mã hóa AES-256-GCM tại D1, không bao giờ lộ ra ngoài.</p>
        </div>
      </form>
      <button type="button" class="btn-card-skip" data-card-skip="payos">Chưa có tài khoản PayOS — để sau</button>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 2: Telegram Bot (Conditional) -->
    <section class="connect-card telegram-card" data-telegram-connect-section>
      <div class="connect-card-header">
        <div class="connect-title-icon">
          <span class="provider-logo-badge telegram-badge">🤖</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Bot Telegram Bán Hàng</h3>
            <p>Tự động gửi menu sản phẩm, tạo link thanh toán QR và gửi key trong tin nhắn riêng.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="connection-status-pill" data-telegram-status-pill data-status="unlinked">Chưa kết nối</span>
      </div>

      <div class="connect-guide-box">
        <strong>💡 Hướng dẫn nhanh:</strong>
        <ol>
          <li>Mở Telegram, tìm bot <a href="https://t.me/BotFather" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@BotFather ↗</a> và gửi lệnh <code>/newbot</code>.</li>
          <li>Đặt tên và username cho bot, sau đó sao chép <code>HTTP API Token</code> dán vào đây.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <form class="credential-form-grid" data-telegram-form novalidate>
        <div class="form-group full-width">
          <label for="telegram-bot-token">HTTP API Token của Bot <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
          <input id="telegram-bot-token" name="botToken" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="1234567890:ABCdefGHIjklMNOpqrsTUVwxyz" required data-input-telegram-token />
        </div>
        <div class="connect-form-actions full-width">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-verify-connect" data-btn-verify-telegram>
            <span>🤖 Kết nối Bot & Cấu hình Webhook</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
      <button type="button" class="btn-card-skip" data-card-skip="telegram">Chưa tạo bot — để sau</button>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="step-actions split-actions">
    <button type="button" class="btn-secondary-back" data-step-back="inventory">
      ← Quay lại
    </button>
    <div class="right-actions">
      <button type="button" class="btn-skip-link" data-step-skip="connect">
        Kết nối sau
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="btn-primary-launch" data-step-submit="connect">
        <span>Hoàn Tất & Mở Bán Ngay</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  /* Display & animation are managed globally by OnboardingShell. */
  .onboarding-step-pane {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .step-intro-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .step-num-badge {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--sln-radius-pill);
    background: var(--sln-tint-primary);
    color: var(--sln-action-primary);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .step-intro-header h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 750;
    color: var(--sln-text-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .step-intro-header p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--sln-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .connect-sections-stack {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .connect-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--sln-border-default);
    border-radius: var(--sln-radius-lg);
    background: var(--sln-bg-surface);
    padding: 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .connect-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .connect-title-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .provider-logo-badge {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: var(--sln-radius-md);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .payos-badge {
    background: #0066FF;
    color: white;
  }

  .telegram-badge {
    background: #24A1DE;
    color: white;
  }

  .connect-title-icon h3 {
    margin: 0 0 3px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--sln-text-primary);
  }

  .connect-title-icon p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--sln-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .connection-status-pill {
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--sln-radius-pill);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .connection-status-pill[data-status="unlinked"] {
    background: var(--sln-bg-subtle);
    color: var(--sln-text-muted);
  }

  .connection-status-pill[data-status="verified"] {
    background: var(--sln-tint-success);
    color: var(--sln-state-success);
  }

  .connection-status-pill[data-status="error"] {
    background: var(--sln-tint-danger);
    color: var(--sln-state-danger);
  }

  .connect-guide-box {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--sln-radius-md);
    background: var(--sln-bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--sln-border-default);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .connect-guide-box strong {
    color: var(--sln-text-primary);
  }

  .connect-guide-box ol {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    color: var(--sln-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .connect-guide-box a {
    color: var(--sln-action-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .connect-guide-box code {
    background: var(--sln-bg-canvas);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: var(--sln-radius-sm);
    font-family: var(--sln-font-mono);
  }

  .credential-form-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .form-group.full-width {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--sln-text-primary);
  }

  .required-star {
    color: var(--sln-state-danger);
  }

  input[type="password"] {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 44px;
    border: 1px solid var(--sln-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--sln-radius-md);
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: var(--sln-bg-surface);
    color: var(--sln-text-primary);
    font-family: var(--sln-font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    outline: none;
  }

  input[type="password"]:focus {
    border-color: var(--sln-focus-ring);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--sln-focus-ring) 20%, transparent);
  }

  .connect-form-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .btn-verify-connect {
    padding: 9px 18px;
    border-radius: var(--sln-radius-pill);
    border: 1px solid var(--sln-action-primary);
    background: var(--sln-tint-primary);
    color: var(--sln-action-primary);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-verify-connect:hover {
    background: var(--sln-action-primary);
    color: var(--sln-white);
  }

  .crypto-note {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--sln-text-muted);
  }

  .btn-card-skip {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 4px 0;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--sln-text-muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: underline dotted;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .btn-card-skip:hover {
    color: var(--sln-text-primary);
  }

  .connect-card.is-skipped {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* Actions */
  .step-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sln-border-default);
  }

  .right-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .btn-skip-link {
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--sln-text-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .btn-skip-link:hover {
    color: var(--sln-text-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .btn-secondary-back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--sln-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--sln-radius-pill);
    background: var(--sln-bg-surface);
    color: var(--sln-text-secondary);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .btn-secondary-back:hover {
    background: var(--sln-bg-subtle);
    color: var(--sln-text-primary);
  }

  .btn-primary-launch {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 12px 26px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--sln-radius-pill);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
    color: var(--sln-white);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 750;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
    transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  }

  .btn-primary-launch:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.45);
  }

  .btn-primary-launch:disabled {
    opacity: 0.6;
    cursor: wait;
    transform: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .step-actions {
      flex-direction: column-reverse;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .btn-primary-launch, .btn-secondary-back {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .connect-form-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
